<section class="section how-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="section-eyebrow">How it works</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">From upload to verdict<br>in under 5 seconds</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="steps-grid">
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">1</div>
        <h3>Upload or Hash</h3>
        <p>Drag and drop a file into the scanner, or paste a SHA256 hash to look up without uploading. Max 100 MB. All file types supported.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-connector">→</div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">2</div>
        <h3>5-Layer Analysis</h3>
        <p>The pipeline runs in parallel: static PE extraction feeds the ML model, threat intel APIs enrich with community data, heuristics scan for attack patterns.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="step-connector">→</div>
      <div class="step-card">
        <div class="step-number">3</div>
        <h3>Verdict + Report</h3>
        <p>Get a clear CLEAN / SUSPICIOUS / MALICIOUS verdict with confidence score, IOC list, MITRE ATT&CK tags, and downloadable PDF report.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "How It Works",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
